<title>NORWAY: Aker Maritime sees better 1997 TO 1996.</title>
<headline>Aker Maritime sees better 1997 TO 1996.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aker Maritime ASA, the Norwegian offshore services company, said on Monday it expected a clear increase in its operating result in 1997 compared with 1996.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement announcing first quarter results that the biggest growth would be in the United States and in Britain, both as a result of contracts signed and acquisitions of new business.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
